          "canonical_hash": "sha256:a0c1690a40c1e8f7e441ff71b86b6b08d94db0c7eaca7466ab002995ccc296c3",
          "description": "Generate an SVG, HTML, data-URL, or rasterized PNG chart from structured data. Supports 14 chart types (bar, column, line, scatter, bubble, pie, polar_area, radar, area, box, histogram, heatmap, gantt, combo) plus 'auto' which picks the best type automatically. Use this when you have data already in memory as a list or dict; for CSV input prefer chart_from_csv instead.",
